        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it is possible.",
        "question": "Can the effect of this card give this Digimon itself a \"road companion\"?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Even if the Digimon digivolves or degenerates, the effect it received is inherited, so the <Digivolve> is still given.",
